url: 'https://erc-automatix.github.io/eshelbyx/'
abstract: >-
  eshelbyx is an open-source library for FFT-based
  computational homogenization of heterogeneous materials.
  It solves the periodic cell problem on voxel grids using
  adaptive and accelerated Eyre-Milton iterative schemes,
  which converge at arbitrary phase contrast including rigid
  inclusions and voids. The library is implemented in JAX and
  builds on jaxmat for constitutive modeling and tensor
  algebra.
